 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Merged 'Other motorcycle helmets' (k152) into Full-face; its open-face models (Bell Custom 500 -> Bell 500 archetype, Schuberth J2, Hedon Heroine) moved to Open-face, modular ones (Nolan N100-6 -> N100 archetype, Schuberth C5 -> C-series, E2) to Modular; AGV X3000 and Bell Bullitt became archetypes. Dropped generic placeholder models ('Full face helmet', 'System helmet'). Left out unconfirmed: Bell Star 1966 date (Wikipedia gives 1968), Bell Moto-3 original 1970s date, Shoei X-Spirit naming and X-Fourteen year, TLD SE4/earlier SE, Fox V1/V2 details, Pista GP launch year, Arai Corsair/RX-7GP dates (rideapart, bennetts, MXA blocked). Shell material and fit as types. No craft traditions apply."
}